# Cloudflare Pages / Netlify rewrite rules.
#
# `go get go.postgrip.io/sdk/client` (or any deeper sub-package path)
# issues GET https://go.postgrip.io/sdk/client?go-get=1 — the request
# must reach our index.html so the <meta name="go-import"> tag is in
# the response. A 200 status (rewrite) keeps the URL intact in the
# browser; a 301/302 (redirect) would lose the ?go-get=1 query in some
# proxy configurations.

/sdk           /index.html  200
/sdk/*         /index.html  200
